      "content": "but what if the \"peace\" you're talking about is just easier if i just stopped being a burden? like, they're so proud of the version of me they think exists. if i just stayed in that memory, they wouldn't have to deal with the reality of how much i've messed up. wouldn't it be kinder to just let them keep that version of me instead of making them watch me fail every single day?",
